{"author":["Elastic"],"building_block_type":"default","description":"检测构建块：未签名BITS服务客户端进程。对应需求：防御规避。官方：Unsigned BITS Service Client Process。","from":"now-119m","index":["logs-endpoint.events.library-*"],"interval":"60m","language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】构建块：未签名BITS服务客户端进程","references":["https://web.archive.org/web/20230531215706/https://blog.menasec.net/2021/05/hunting-for-suspicious-usage-of.html","https://www.elastic.co/blog/hunting-for-persistence-using-elastic-security-part-2"],"risk_score":21,"rule_id":"9a3884d0-282d-45ea-86ce-b9c81100f026","severity":"low","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 防御规避","来源: 默认","对应需求: 防御规避"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"library where dll.name : \"Bitsproxy.dll\" and process.executable != null and\nnot process.code_signature.trusted == true and\nnot process.code_signature.status : (\"errorExpired\", \"errorCode_endpoint*\")\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1036","name":"Masquerading","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1036/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1036.001","name":"Invalid Code Signature","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1036/001/"}]},{"id":"T1197","name":"BITS Jobs","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1197/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0005","name":"Defense Evasion","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0005/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"}],"note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n构建块：未签名BITS服务客户端进程\n\n### 为何重要\n绕过防护、伪装或擦痕\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 按规则数据源接入对应日志（终端、云、身份或网络）。\n2. 构建块规则用于关联，确认数据流有数据后再评估。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","cloud.account.id","process.name","process.command_line","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","event.action","message"]},"version":6,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
